ed Reality environment from your smartphone or PC completely independently!\n \n- Register on the webapp (app.themetagate.it) via email or Google.\n- Subscribe to log in with the same credentials on the OpenGate app on the viewer.\n- Upload images, videos or 3D models that you can interact with in MR (move, scale and save position).\n- Create a 3D travelling companion with customisable artificial intelligence (GPT based) that you can talk to in MR.\n\nSupported formats:\n- Images: png, jpg;\n- Video: mp4;\n- 3D models: glb, fbx.", "short_description": "Create your own experience with the first Mixed Reality builder.\nUpload your assets: images, videos and 3D models. Even add your own AI Avatar. All without code!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://discover.themetagate.it/pages/policy-privacy-opengate-xr", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Unity", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://discover.themetagate.it/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1819021644882647"}, {"id": "1063584910766706"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "24305885949005963"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499332686_1369920530925848_677161030047362608_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3IcNMe5kG6AQ7kNvwH8JuHh&_nc_oc=AdnybwymnzK